Z||000000||1FST2M6||08-13-2000||08:07 PM||||  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/gtrearnparts.jpg">  <P>this is the DAY after the car was delivered to atlanta from Billings, mt. The girlfriend, Todd (blackgt) and i worked on it for about 5.5 hours to get it this far...  it leaves for the body shop on thursday. She'll get the frame checked so that EVERYTHING lines up ok, all the panels preped and ready and then I and my old boss will be shooting the car. I'll be sure to post pics the day its shot! here are some more or her apart...<P>the antenna hole fiberglased over...<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/antngroundeffect.jpg">  <P>the badging holes 'glased in<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/holesfilled.jpg">  <P>and 1/4 windows removed along with the fiberglas piece behind them... <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/othernoquarter_1.jpg">  <P>the engine-bay vents are at the powder coater already, so they don't fade life the factory ones did... the head light doors taken off and the headlight baskets donated to a local fiero nut. to be replaced with CATZ lighting CL157s. what do ya think?<P><p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 08-13-2000).]||||reg||1
